{"product":{"id":6236193423548,"title":"Norix Oasis Cafeteria Table – O43048 \/ O43072","body_html":"\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003eNorix Oasis Cafeteria Table\u003c\/strong\u003e is a four-seat cluster table made for dayrooms, dining halls, and visitation areas in prisons, detention centers, and behavioral healthcare facilities. Unlike a stool, each molded seat has a back for support, and swivel seats make it easier to sit down and get up.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe heavy steel frame is fully welded and supports both the top and the seats. The one-piece seats are rotationally molded from high-impact polyethylene and attach through molded-in threaded steel inserts, and all connections use Torx® security hardware. The table comes in 30”×48” and 30”×72” sizes, with a laminate plain top, game top, or stainless steel inlay top.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eFrame:\u003c\/strong\u003e Fully welded 3”×1½” rectangle tube and 2” square steel tube, with 10-gauge steel top and seat mounting plates\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eTop:\u003c\/strong\u003e High-pressure laminate over a 45 lb density M3 particle board core, with a 1½” thick radiused molded edge that is pressure fused to the top\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eStainless Steel Inlay Top:\u003c\/strong\u003e Type 304 stainless steel with a radiused Slammer Stone edge, 1¼” thick\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eTop Attachment:\u003c\/strong\u003e Embedded T-nuts give a steel-to-steel connection between the top and base\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSeats:\u003c\/strong\u003e One-piece rotationally molded high-impact polyethylene with back support, fixed or swivel\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eTop Sizes:\u003c\/strong\u003e 30”×48” or 30”×72”\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eHeights:\u003c\/strong\u003e 31” table, 18.3” seat, 34” seat back\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSeat Width:\u003c\/strong\u003e 17”\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWeight:\u003c\/strong\u003e 220 lbs (30”×48”) or 280 lbs (30”×72”)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePlain Top Finishes:\u003c\/strong\u003e Titanium Evolve, Wild Cherry, Kensington Maple, Asian Sun, Montana Walnut, Palisades Oak, Calcutta Marble, or Black Alicante laminate with a matching or black molded edge\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eGame Top:\u003c\/strong\u003e Optional Titanium Evolve laminate with a printed game board, black molded edge\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSeat Colors:\u003c\/strong\u003e Twilight, Cove, Sage, Clay, Sand, Dove\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eStatic Load Testing:\u003c\/strong\u003e Tested to 1,000 lbs\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEnvironmental Certification:\u003c\/strong\u003e GREENGUARD and GREENGUARD Gold\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWarranty:\u003c\/strong\u003e 10-year limited replacement warranty\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eIntended Use:\u003c\/strong\u003e Indoor use only\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCountry of Manufacture:\u003c\/strong\u003e USA\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAvailable Models and Options\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eO43048 – 30”×48”:\u003c\/strong\u003e Laminate plain top, game top, or stainless steel inlay top with fixed seats, 220 lbs\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eO43072 – 30”×72”:\u003c\/strong\u003e Laminate plain top or stainless steel inlay top, with fixed or swivel seats, 280 lbs\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eInstallation and Options\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eGlides or Bolt-Down:\u003c\/strong\u003e Free-standing with tamper-resistant glides, or bolt-down with concealed concrete expansion anchors included in the bolt-down kit\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSwivel Seats:\u003c\/strong\u003e 12-gauge powder-coated swivel mechanism with 60° rotation\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eADA Version:\u003c\/strong\u003e Available in the 30”×72” size\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAssembly:\u003c\/strong\u003e See Norix instructions\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eApplications\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Norix Oasis Cafeteria Table suits dining halls, dayrooms, and visitation areas where people need more back support than a stool gives.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTypical applications include:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDayrooms and dining halls in correctional and detention facilities\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBehavioral healthcare facilities and psychiatric hospitals\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVisitation areas, classrooms, and other common areas\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eExplore Anchortex's \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/www.anchortex.com\/collections\/bh-behavioral-healthcare-furniture\"\u003eBehavioral Healthcare Anti-Ligature Furniture\u003c\/a\u003e and \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/www.anchortex.com\/collections\/cd-correctional-furniture\"\u003ePrison and Detention Furniture\u003c\/a\u003e collections for more institutional furniture.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eAbout Norix Dayroom and Dining Tables\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNorix tables are made for dayrooms, dining halls, classrooms, and visitation areas in correctional and behavioral healthcare facilities, where furniture is used hard every day. The range covers molded-base tables such as the Jupiter, Evvolve, and Molded X-Base; Laminate X-Base tables; and steel-base tables such as the Leg Style, Multi-Purpose, Max-Master, and Oasis.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCommon characteristics of Norix tables include:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDurable Tops:\u003c\/strong\u003e High-pressure laminate over a dense particle board core, with molded or T-mold edges depending on the model\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSecure Connections:\u003c\/strong\u003e Tops attach to the base with tamper-resistant hardware for a solid metal-to-metal connection\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003ePlacement Options:\u003c\/strong\u003e Depending on the model, tables can be ballasted, bolted to the floor, or set on tamper-resistant glides\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEasy Cleaning:\u003c\/strong\u003e Smooth surfaces that stand up to routine cleaning in high-traffic areas\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMade in the USA:\u003c\/strong\u003e Built by Norix in the United States\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eAbout Norix Furniture\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNorix manufactures durable furniture for demanding environments, including behavioral healthcare facilities, psychiatric hospitals, police stations, correctional institutions, and residential treatment centers. Explore the full line of \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/www.anchortex.com\/collections\/norix-furniture\"\u003eNorix Furniture\u003c\/a\u003e at Anchortex.\u003c\/p\u003e","vendor":"Norix","product_type":"","created_at":"2021-01-29T13:18:41-05:00","handle":"norix-oasis-cafeteria-table","updated_at":"2026-11-26T18:27:51-05:00","published_at":"2021-01-29T13:18:41-05:00","template_suffix":"","published_scope":"web","tags":"Behavioral Healthcare Furniture, bh-behavioral-health-care-furniture-group-dining-areas, cd-furn-cafeteria, Prison-Furniture","variants":[{"id":37961016967356,"product_id":6236193423548,"title":"30x48 Plain Top, Fixed Seats","price":"3472.00","sku":"N700233-01","position":1,"compare_at_price":"4340.00","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":"shopify","option1":"30x48 Plai